& [NativeBuildExecutionPlan] is one effect proposal after native candidate projection
  + binds plan seed candidate projection build contract runner sandbox profile command environment disposable root output and logical validity identities and digests
  + requested capabilities are exactly source_read build file_write and process_execute
  + network install and external_effect are absent
  + command is an exact argument vector derived from the candidate build contract without shell interpretation
  + root and output policies are create-new relative identities with no navigation absolute prefix drive prefix or alias
  + time process memory stdout stderr output-byte and artifact bounds are finite and one artifact is exact
  + lifecycle is proposed and non-authoritative

& [NativeBuildCapabilityReceipt] accounts the exact later-stage plan against the seed ceiling
  + binds plan candidate ceiling requested admitted denied resource scopes evidence disposition and digest
  + admitted and denied sets form an exact disjoint partition
  + within_ceiling requires every requested capability admitted no denial complete scoped evidence and exact seed ceiling containment
  + never inherits authority from the earlier read-only CandidateCompilationPlan receipt

& [NativeSandboxAdmission] is supplied physical-containment evidence
  + binds provider platform profile sandbox root policy network repository seal credential executable environment evidence validity and digest
  + physical mode is proven_for_profile or unresolved
  + admitted requires proven_for_profile network denied repository seal and credential writes denied exact executable and environment correspondence nonempty evidence and current logical time
  + path grammar validation alone cannot produce admitted

& [NativeBuildApprovalStatement] is the exact permission subject
  + binds seed build plan capability receipt sandbox admission candidate runner validity single-use policy and non-authority
  + Security approval and external-authority approval sign the same normalized statement bytes

& [NativeBuildAuthorizationCertificate] is dual cryptographic approval
  + binds statement Security signer authority signer Ed25519 profile signatures and self-excluding digest
  + signer identities equal the seed Security and authority trust-root references
  + supplied trust material maps those exact identities to valid Ed25519 verifying keys
  + both signatures must verify and revoked certificate identities refuse
  + authorization permits only one attempt under a separate runner; it does not prove the effect occurred

& [NativeBuildObservation] is one runner-supplied attempt record
  + binds attempt authorization candidate plan runner sandbox command environment build-input root logical start and finish disposition exit stdout stderr resources artifacts faults and digest
  + disposition is succeeded failed timed_out cancelled or infrastructure_fault
  + succeeded requires exact zero exit no faults bounds satisfied and exactly one artifact matching expected identity and relative path
  + every other disposition requires no artifact receipt projection
  + observed artifact binds identity path digest bytes media type target triple and build-input root

& [NativeArtifactReceipt] is a produced but unverified byte identity
  + derives through whole replay from candidate plan capability sandbox approval authorization and successful observation
  + binds all upstream identities and the exact observed artifact
  + lifecycle is produced_unverified
  + fixed non-authority excludes reproducibility interface behavior semantic correctness safety signature admission installation deployment execution and successor recognition

& [NativeArtifactVerificationPlan] is an independent immutable check contract
  + binds artifact receipt expected identity digest bytes media type target interface schemas verifier program verifier identity evidence requirements optional second-build requirement and digest
  + verifier identity differs from runner identity and approval signers
  + checks are predeclared and no model-selected command or hidden environment is admitted

& [NativeArtifactVerificationObservation] supplies independent check facts
  + binds plan verifier independently observed artifact identity digest bytes target interface evidence and optional second-build receipt
  + second-build reproducibility is true only when a distinct attempt and authorization produce an equal artifact identity digest and byte size under the required toolchain and input roots

& [NativeArtifactVerificationReceipt] derives pass fail or unresolved
  + binds exact plan artifact observation check account evidence unresolved non-authority and digest
  + passed requires every predeclared check passed no unresolved items and complete independence
  + failed preserves mismatches and unresolved preserves absent independent evidence
  + no disposition grants signing admission installation deployment execution or successor recognition

& [EffectBoundary]
  + cantor_core may validate plan capability sandbox approval observation receipt and verification forms and may invoke only an injected runner trait in tests
  + production filesystem process clock environment and network access belongs to a separately governed host adapter
  + no production host adapter is authorized by this specification

& [FaultModel]
  + profile lineage backend digest capability scope sandbox signature revocation time command environment runner path budget exit artifact target interface verifier independence reproducibility unknown-field and replay faults fail closed
  + partial observations remain evidence and never become successful receipts
  + no automatic retry cleanup overwrite or fallback occurs

& [Acceptance]
  + equal complete inputs yield byte-identical forms and domain-separated digests
  + dual signatures validate against exact seed-bound trust material
  + every named substitution and capability expansion refuses
  + fake successful runner observation produces exactly one produced_unverified artifact receipt
  + failed timeout cancelled and faulted observations produce no artifact receipt
  + independent verification cannot be authored by the build runner and cannot grant later lifecycle authority
  + focused debug optimized release unchanged compiler full workspace warnings-denied lint format evidence and diff gates pass

& [NonGoals]
  + production process runner physical sandbox implementation source generation dependency fetch network signing artifact admission installation deployment execution self-replacement internal llama.cpp FPGA OneDrive EVO-X2 and Minecraft

